    "sections": {
        "description": "The Electrician Company theme is a modern, elegant, and multipurpose solution tailored for professional electricians, electrical contractors, and service providers specializing in electrical repair, installation, wiring, maintenance, home automation, generator setup, and emergency electrical support. Designed with a clean and responsive layout, it ensures a mobile-friendly, retina-ready experience with optimized performance and fast page loading powered by secure, lightweight code built on the Bootstrap framework. Ideal for residential, commercial, and industrial electricians, this theme includes visually appealing sections for service listings, testimonials, team showcases, and banners with strategic Call to Action (CTA) buttons to boost conversions. With built-in shortcodes, interactive animations, and social media integration, customization becomes effortless and engaging. The theme is fully translation-ready, SEO-friendly, and agency-friendly, making it suitable for both local and global businesses. Compatible with Contact Form 7 for seamless inquiry handling, WooCommerce for booking and payment functionalities, and WPML for multilingual capability, the Electrician Company theme empowers professionals to create a strong, high-performing, and professional digital presence that highlights their expertise and drives business growth."
    },
